The shrine precinct includes various stone shrines dedicated to deities such as {{ill|Mishima Taisha|ja|三嶋神社|12=draft|12=draft}}, {{ill|Izu-san Shrine|ja|伊豆山神社|12=draft|12=draft}}, {{ill|Hakone Shrine|ja|箱根神社|12=draft|12=draft}}, and others.

== Festivals ==
The Spring Festival is held annually from {{ill|April 2|ja|4月2日|12=draft|12=draft}}, and the Autumn Festival occurs from {{ill|September 18|ja|9月18日|12=draft|12=draft}}. Historical records indicate that events such as horseback archery were once part of the celebrations.

== Access ==
'''Address'''
* {{ill|Fukushima Prefecture|ja|福島県|12=draft|12=draft}}, {{ill|Kōriyama|ja|郡山市|12=draft|12=draft}}, Mihota-machi Hachiman, Kamino-dai 76

=== Public Transportation ===
* From {{ill|Koriyama Station|ja|郡山駅|12=draft|12=draft}}, take the No. 2 bus bound for Nagahama (approx. 35 minutes). Alight at Mihota Community Center and walk immediately.

=== By Car ===
* About 10 minutes from {{ill|Koriyama-Minami IC|ja|郡山南インターチェンジ|12=draft|12=draft}}.

