'''Unakorowake Shrine''' (宇奈己呂和気神社) is a {{ill|Shinto shrine|ja|神社|qq=draft|qq=draft}} located in {{ill|Kōriyama|ja|郡山市|qq=draft|qq=draft}}, {{ill|Fukushima Prefecture|ja|福島県|qq=draft|qq=draft}}. It is a {{ill|Shikinai shrine|ja|式内社|1=Shikinaisha|qq=draft|qq=draft}} ({{ill|Myōjin taisha|ja|名神大社|fr|Myōjin Taisha|zh|名神大社|qq=draft|qq=draft}}), and its former shrine Ranking under the {{ill|Modern system of Ranked Shinto shrines|ja|近代社格制度|1=Modern system of Ranked Shinto shrines|qq=draft|qq=draft}} was {{ill|Gōsha|ja|郷社|qq=draft|qq=draft}}.
[[Unakoro Waki Shrine]] is a regional [[Sōja (Shinto)|Sōja shrine]]. It enshrines many kami of the local region.

It contrasts with provincial Soja shrines which enshrine all the kami of a province<ref>https://archive.ph/wip/XtZfZ</ref>


== Enshrined Deities ==
'''Main deity'''
* '''{{ill|Seoritsuhime|ja|瀬織津比売命|qq=draft|qq=draft}}''' - One of the {{ill|Haraedo-no-Ōkami|ja|祓戸大神|qq=draft|qq=draft}}

'''Secondary deity'''
* {{ill|Hachiman|ja|八幡神|qq=draft|qq=draft}}: Hondawake-no-Mikoto ({{ill|Emperor Ōjin|ja|応神天皇|qq=draft|qq=draft}})

