* {{ill|Jōgan|ja|貞観|qq=draft|qq=draft}} 11 ({{ill|869|ja|869th year|qq=draft|qq=draft}}): Senior Fifth Rank, Lower Grade ({{ill|Nihon Sandai Jitsuroku|ja|日本三代実録|qq=draft|qq=draft}})

== Shrine Grounds ==
=== Main Shrine ===
The shrine comprises a haiden, heiden, and a covered three-bay honden in {{ill|Miya-zukuri|ja|流造|qq=draft|qq=draft}} style. The honden features three doors, symbolizing the deities enshrined. Presently, the shrine honors two deities, with one seat left vacant.

