=== Torii and approach ===
Passing through the '''torii''', visitors cross a small stream. To the west of the approach are a memorial stone and the '''Suitengū''' (dedicated to {{ill|Ame-no-Minakanushi|ja|天之御中主神|qq=draft|qq=draft|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Ame-no-Minakanushi|qq=}}), while the shrine office lies to the right.  
