'''Interior of the Haiden'''

The haiden displays large ema boards, including "Susanoo slaying Yamata-no-Orochi" and "Kato Kiyomasa hunting a tiger." Additionally, a plaque commemorates when {{ill|Itō Hirobumi|en|Itō Hirobumi|WD=Q174971|lt=Itō Hirobumi|1=Itō Hirobumi}} visited the shrine during the Asaka Canal Completion tier 5]]), while the shrine office lies to the right.  
